==Battleground==
*3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[B.B.Bunny]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
*3 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Extremely easy stage. The main problem is the One Horns but they are still trivial with enough of a stack. Bring some meatshields and area attackers like [[Paris Cat]] and you'll be fine.

